SUMMARY:🚶‍♂️Guided Walking Tour of Yorkville + Food/Drinks After
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nOn **We
 dnesday\, July 22nd**\, **join a Guided Walking Tour of Yorkville provided
  by the Royal Ontario Museum.** Evolving from an 1800’s tollgate village
  at the edge of Toronto to an upscale commercial destination\, see how thi
 s iconic neighbourhood has maintained its character despite being engulfed
  by the city. These Tours are guided by docents\, and run rain or shine. H
 owever\, if the forecast calls for rain\, I will make a call 3 hours prior
  if I will show up\, as others may want to continue in the rain.\n\n**Prep
 are for the walk:**\n\n* Walking shoes\n* Hat\n* Sunglasses\n* Water\n\n**
 SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if you will join for food/drinks a
 fter**\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder
  details where to meet and when.\nRSVPs close 1 day prior. cancellations w
 ill be marked as a No Show.\n\n🗓️ **Event Details**\n📍 **Meet me: 
 at 5:45pm at 1 Yorkville Ave (SW corner at Yonge). We will then join the r
 est of the tour group at Yorkville Library at 22 Yorkville Ave.**\n🚶‍
 ♂️ **Walk Start Time:** **6pm**\n⏱️ **Walk** **time:** less than 2
  hours\n🏁 **Tour ends:** ROM\, corner of Bloor St. and Queen’s Park (
 100 Queen’s Park\, Toronto\n**After:** Head over to a local restaurant f
 or food and drinks\n🎟️ **Cost:** $5\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group
 :** [Click here to join](#)\n\n🎥 **A Quick Word About Walking Etiquette
 **\nWe love a great film experience. Please:\n\n* Turn off your phone\n* D
 on’t talk while the tour guide is speaking\n* Be respectful of others\n\
 nRepeat offenders will be removed from the group.\n\n👥 **About the Grou
 p**\nThis event is open to everyone — single\, not single\, shy\, social
 \, new in town or a long-time local. We're a group for people who love mov
 ies *and* making real connections. We also do walks\, hikes\, restaurants\
 , arts & culture — come be part of it!\n\n🎬 **Group** **Organized by:
 ** Matthew\n📧 Questions? Reach out: **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.c
 om**
