SUMMARY:🎂🎉🥳Wingsanity St Louis w/$24.99 AYCE  🍗🔥🐔
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n**🎉 
 Feast & Wing Party at St. Louis! 🎉**\n\n**📅 Sunday\\\, August 2 \\| 
 🕚 11:00 AM \\| 📍 St\\. Louis Bar & Grill\\\, 376 Bloor St\\. West**\
 n\nWhat better way to spend a Sunday than with great company and endless w
 ings\, ? 🍗🎂\n\nJoin us as we gather at **St. Louis Bar & Grill** for
  their epic **[AYCE Wingsanity](https://www.stlouiswings.com/wingsanity/)*
 *[ event](https://www.stlouiswings.com/wingsanity/) — all you can eat **
 Original\, Dusted\, Boneless\, and Plant-Based Wings** for just **$24.99**
 ! Whether you’re a fan of classic Buffalo heat\, crave something sweet\,
  or like to explore the sauce spectrum\, this feast is for you.\n\nOf cour
 se endless wings aren't for everyone so they have plenty of [other options
  on the menu too. ](https://www.stlouiswings.com/stlouis-menu/?cachebuster
 =1762269057)\n\nSt. Louis opens at **11:00 AM**\, but Nick will be there a
  little earlier to grab us a good table. Come hungry and ready to celebrat
 e!\n\n💸 **Cost:** Each member is responsible for their own food and dri
 nks.\n📍 **Location:** St. Louis Bar & Grill\, 376 Bloor St. West (near 
 Spadina Station)\n\n🕚 **Meet Time:** 11:00 AM (Nick will be there a bit
  before opening)\nPlease RSVP early so we can plan seating — and get rea
 dy to raise a glass (and a wing) to Nick’s big day! 🍻
